      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hi Daisuke,\n\n\u0027battery_sustainer_disable\u0027 will be run if \u0027get_chg_ctrl_mode\u0027 returns that chg_ctl_mode is not CHARGE_CONTROL_NORMAL, but chg_ctl_mode is set to CHARGE_CONTROL_NORMAL by default in \u0027charger_task\u0027. Therefore, \u0027set_chg_ctrl_mode\u0027 have to be run before the judgement of whether to run \u0027battery_sustainer_set\u0027 or \u0027battery_sustainer_disable\u0027. Otherwise, the battery sustain will be enabled when \u0027ectool chargecontrol discharge\u0027 is given at the moment the chg_ctl_mode is CHARGE_CONTROL_NORMAL.\n\nThanks!",
